    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_folding_set_vector" kindref="compound">FoldingSetVector</ref> - This template class combines a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_folding_set" kindref="compound">FoldingSet</ref> and a vector to provide the interface of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_folding_set" kindref="compound">FoldingSet</ref> but with deterministic iteration order based on the insertion order. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>T must be a subclass of <ref refid="namespacellvm_1a368e3de8ea854f34bc97c21a64d6a164" kindref="member">FoldingSetNode</ref> and implement a Profile function. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
